{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Killing形式"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“Killing 形式”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#代数</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Lie代数","text":"Lie 代数"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak g$ 的 Killing 形式是 $\\mathfrak g$ 上的双线性型\n$$\r\nB(X,Y)=\\operatorname{tr}(\\operatorname{ad}_X\\operatorname{ad}_Y).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathfrak {gl}_n$ 的 Killing 形式为 $B(X,Y) = 2n\\operatorname{tr}(XY)-2\\operatorname{tr}(X)\\operatorname{tr}(Y)$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathfrak {sl}_n$ 的 Killing 形式为 $B(X,Y)=2n\\operatorname{tr}(XY)$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}